  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons dried parsley",
    "2 tablespoons ground dried rosemary",
    "2 tablespoons rubbed dried sage",
    "2 tablespoons dried thyme leaves",
    "1 tablespoon lemon-pepper seasoning",
    "1 tablespoon salt",
    "1 (15 pound) whole turkey, neck and giblets removed",
    "1 medium orange, cut into 8 wedges",
    "1 medium onion, chopped into large pieces",
    "1 medium carrot, cut into 1/2-inch slices",
    "2 stalks celery, cut into 1/2-inch slices",
    "1 (750 milliliter) bottle champagne",
    "1 (14.5 ounce) can chicken broth"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line a roasting pan with enough aluminum foil to wrap around turkey.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pq3yP8FJoa5PQWCi1e0HwtlA1_I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-166160-juicy-thanksgiving-turkey-VAT-4889-Step-01-0de5aa89db4249519095a2a71b65e29f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/166160/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir parsley, rosemary, sage, thyme, lemon-pepper seasoning, and salt together in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XnLH2yoWQm8YoNO1jlR-sXpgDAY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-166160-juicy-thanksgiving-turkey-VAT-4891-Step-02-02e31be692904040a5dfaa84356efa7a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/166160/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rub herb mixture into turkey cavity; stuff with orange wedges, onion, carrot, and celery. Tie turkey legs together with kitchen twine; tuck wings behind body.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uRjlvjyVxxEA6z_WIQZs-20vTGU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-166160-juicy-thanksgiving-turkey-VAT-4925-Step-03-00b9c21c1f694cd598a648a380e54166.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/166160/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place turkey on the foil in the roasting pan. Pour champagne and chicken broth over turkey, getting some in cavity.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zfXzPF9b6LIn15WVLRfUJ7xoshc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-166160-juicy-thanksgiving-turkey-VAT-4929-Step-04-02c772593915468090f56effbc61e11f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/166160/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring the aluminum foil up and around turkey; try to keep the foil from touching turkey.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VIAFfJVUo7PhH8Mo_JT0MqyLkI4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-166160-juicy-thanksgiving-turkey-VAT-4931-Step-05-60d332818c6f4ac6adc6b75b88811c98.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/166160/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast turkey in the preheated oven until juices run clear, 2 ½ to 3 hours. Uncover turkey; continue cooking until skin turns golden brown, 30 to 60 minutes more. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of thigh near the bone, should read 180 degrees F (80 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dSEntycmw3JNj7YXXrxSZZUqyvM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-166160-juicy-thanksgiving-turkey-VAT-4933-Step-06-f0526170cb884659983b055fca1570a9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/166160/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove turkey from the oven, cover with two sheets of aluminum foil; let rest in a warm area, 10 to 15 minutes before carving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BYaPkoGhz9w18cTZJuSTlTBzwV8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-166160-juicy-thanksgiving-turkey-VAT-4935-Step-07-f12a733f73494d67add2a70dcbbae417.jpg"
      ],
